{
  "description": "Detection signatures for compiled language binaries (Go, Rust, Haskell, Crystal, Zig, GraalVM native-image) where the executable name is application-specific and unpredictable. Identity is established via ELF string table scanning and known framework/runtime markers. Named framework matches get a specific profile; unmatched binaries of a detected language get allow_cwd=true so vandam grants cwd-scoped write access without false-positive escalation.",

